    "detailed_description": "Welcome to \u201cA Diary of an International Student,\u201d a brand-new simulation and Pachinko roguelite game. Here, you will experience the life of studying abroad and face endless challenges and fun!<br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2705 30+ Orbs <br>\ud83d\udd25 30+ Moods<br>\ud83c\udfb2 60+ Random Events <br>\u2753 50+ Relics<br><strong>Life Simulation:</strong><br>* Daily Activities: Attend classes, work part-time, hang out at the bar, socialise... every day brings something new to discover! Balance your activities to achieve better results in your life.<br><strong>Battle System:</strong><br>* Pachinko: Engage in fixed weekly pinball battles to fend off various monsters you might encounter while studying abroad. Each monster has its own unique characteristics.<br><strong>Advanced Gameplay:</strong><br>* Mood System: Maintaining a good mood during your study abroad journey is crucial. Different moods will affect the difficulty of battles and life simulations.<br><strong>More Features:</strong><br>* Every choice you make in the game will impact your life and battles. The weather will also influence the game.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to \u201cA Diary of an International Student,\u201d a brand-new simulation and Pachinko roguelite game. Here, you will experience the life of studying abroad and face endless challenges and fun!<br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2705 30+ Orbs <br>\ud83d\udd25 30+ Moods<br>\ud83c\udfb2 60+ Random Events <br>\u2753 50+ Relics<br><strong>Life Simulation:</strong><br>* Daily Activities: Attend classes, work part-time, hang out at the bar, socialise... every day brings something new to discover! Balance your activities to achieve better results in your life.<br><strong>Battle System:</strong><br>* Pachinko: Engage in fixed weekly pinball battles to fend off various monsters you might encounter while studying abroad. Each monster has its own unique characteristics.<br><strong>Advanced Gameplay:</strong><br>* Mood System: Maintaining a good mood during your study abroad journey is crucial. Different moods will affect the difficulty of battles and life simulations.<br><strong>More Features:</strong><br>* Every choice you make in the game will impact your life and battles. The weather will also influence the game.",
    "short_description": "The Diary of an International Student, a captivating simulation and Pachinko rogue-lite game. Make decisions, develop skills, collect powerful relics, and maintain mental well-being to face simulated adversaries. Navigate the unique challenges of student life abroad in this strategic adventure.",
